 우회한다. 이동로가 확보되고 방어 위치를 확인함일 때 성벽의 공격과 진입 방향이 바뀐다\",\"capabilities\":[\"SESSION_FLOW\",\"CONTENT_ENTITY\",\"COMBAT\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false},{\"index\":2,\"step\":\"전투와 획득 장비의 조합 운용로 되돌아가 변한 세계 상태·관계·위험을 비교하고 다음 목표를 선택한다.\",\"capabilities\":[\"COMBAT\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false}],\"signatureSystemTrace\":[{\"index\":0,\"name\":\"마력숲 생존기\",\"capabilities\":[\"WORLD\",\"CONTENT_ENTITY\",\"COMBAT\",\"ENEMY_AI\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false},{\"index\":1,\"name\":\"전투와 획득 장비의 조합 운용 × 철학·사상\",\"capabilities\":[\"CONTENT_ENTITY\",\"COMBAT\",\"ENEMY_AI\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false},{\"index\":2,\"name\":\"제작과 방어 거점 관리 × 공성전\",\"capabilities\":[\"SESSION_FLOW\",\"CONTENT_ENTITY\",\"COMBAT\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false},{\"index\":3,\"name\":\"암호문: 독립된 단서가 같은 의미를 지지함의 성립\",\"capabilities\":[\"SESSION_FLOW\",\"CONTENT_ENTITY\",\"COMBAT\",\"ENEMY_AI\",\"EQUIPMENT\"],\"pass\":false}],\"placeholderDebt\":{\"primitiveConstructionCount\":0,\"meshConstructionCount\":0,\"likelyPrimitiveHeavy\":false,\"genericScopeHandlerCount\":6,\"meaningfulGameplayFunctionCount\":0},\"studioQualitySheet\":{\"Core\":\"MISSING\",\"Content\":\"MISSING\",\"World\":\"MISSING\",\"Combat\":\"MISSING\",\"AI\":\"MISSING\",\"Progression\":\"MISSING\",\"UI\":\"POLISHED\",\"Graphics\":\"ROUGH\",\"Motion\":\"POLISHED\",\"Audio\":\"MISSING\",\"Mobile\":\"POLISHED\",\"Performance\":\"MISSING\",\"Runtime\":\"N/A\"},\"studioReadiness\":{\"ai\":{\"applicable\":true,\"signalCount\":0,\"pass\":false},\"combatFeel\":{\"applicable\":true,\"signalCount\":2,\"pass\":false},\"worldTopology\":{\"applicable\":true,\"signalCount\":1,\"pass\":false},\"firstTenMinutes\":{\"signalCount\":4,\"pass\":true},\"midLateGame\":{\"applicable\":true,\"signalCount\":3,\"pass\":true},\"systemConnections\":{\"rows\":[{\"id\":\"EQUIPMENT_TO_COMBAT\",\"pass\":false},{\"id\":\"WORLD_TO_CONTENT\",\"pass\":false}],\"pass\":false},\"placeholder\":{\"pass\":true,\"primitiveConstructionCount\":0,\"meshConstructionCount\":0,\"likel